---
import CategoryLayout from '../../layouts/CategoryLayout.astro';
---

<CategoryLayout
  title="Roofing Automation ROI Calculators"
  description="Free ROI calculators for roofing companies evaluating CRM, lead follow-up automation, AI receptionists, and call tracking tools."
  category="Calculators"
  intro="These calculators help roofing owners and sales managers estimate the return on automation tools before committing to a subscription."
>
  <div class="calc-coming-soon">
    <p class="calc-icon" aria-hidden="true">🧮</p>
    <h2>Calculators Coming Soon</h2>
    <p>We're building interactive ROI calculators for:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Lead Follow-Up Automation — estimated jobs recovered from faster response</li>
      <li>Missed Call Text Back — estimated revenue from captured missed calls</li>
      <li>AI Receptionist — estimated cost vs. human receptionist</li>
      <li>CRM Adoption — time saved per week on manual follow-up</li>
    </ul>
    <p>In the meantime, download the free <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + '/templates/lead-follow-up-checklist/'}>Lead Follow-Up Automation Checklist</a> to start implementing today.</p>
  </div>
</CategoryLayout>

<style>
  .calc-coming-soon {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 3rem 1rem;
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .calc-icon { font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }

  .calc-coming-soon ul {
    text-align: left;
    display: inline-block;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }
</style>
